## Additional Terms for NASA Data

This software incorporates data from NASA's Earth Science Data Systems, including
but not limited to CYGNSS, MODIS, and Sentinel missions. Use of this data is
subject to NASA's data use policies:

- NASA Earthdata: https://earthdata.nasa.gov/collaborate/open-data-services-and-software/data-information-policy
- CYGNSS Data Policy: https://cygnss.eecs.umich.edu/data-products/
- MODIS Data Policy: https://modis.gsfc.nasa.gov/data/datapolicy/

